max=5},{l1=33,l2=35,tree="Discipline",name=S[480],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=36,l2=36,tree="Discipline",name=S[612],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=37,l2=37,tree="Discipline",name=S[470],r1=1,r2=1,max=3},{l1=38,l2=38,tree="Discipline",name="Penance",r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=39,l2=42,tree="Discipline",name=S[576],r1=1,r2=4,max=5},{l1=43,l2=43,tree="Discipline",name=S[577],r1=1,r2=1,max=3},{l1=44,l2=44,tree="Discipline",name=S[576],r1=5,r2=5,max=5},{l1=45,l2=46,tree="Discipline",name=S[577],r1=2,r2=3,max=3},{l1=47,l2=47,tree="Discipline",name=S[470],r1=2,r2=2,max=3},{l1=48,l2=48,tree="Discipline",name=S[537],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=49,l2=53,tree="Holy",name=S[403],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=54,l2=58,tree="Holy",name="Divine Fury",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=59,l2=59,tree="Discipline",name=S[470],r1=3,r2=3,max=3},{l1=60,l2=60,tree="Discipline",name="Inner Focus",r1=1,r2=1,max=1}},blocks={{t="anchor",id="overview"},{t="p",s="eyebrow",x=S[413]},{t="h1",x="Discipline",sub=S[481]},{t="p",s="lede",x="Shield, heal and smite: Power Word: Shield buys time, Penance heals an ally or hits an enemy, and critical heals add Divine Aegis shields and shorten Weakened Soul through Renewed Hope."},{t="pills",list={S[519],"Dungeon healing and solo damage",S[448]}},{t="anchor",id="journey"},{t="kicker",x=S[553]},{t="h2",x=S[355]},{t="p",x="These stages follow the talent order below. Leveling as a healer is slower alone, but Discipline has the most damage of the two healing trees, and Penance works for both healing and damage."},{t="p",s="level",x=S[547]},{t="p",x="Shoot with a wand between Smite and Shadow Word: Pain casts; Power Word: Shield arrives at 6 and Renew at 8. Wand Specialization 2/2 at 11 adds 25% wand damage, Spirit Tap 5/5 by 16 doubles your Spirit after kills, and Twilight Focus 3/3 by 19 gives every spell a 70% chance to ignore pushback."},{t="p",s="level",x="20–39 · Power in Light and Penance"},{t="p",x="Holy Fire arrives at 20, so Power in Light 5/5 by 24 makes Smite and Penance hit 10% harder on targets with your Holy Fire or Shadow Word: Pain. Mental Strength and Meditation follow (50% of mana regeneration while casting by 30). Improved Power Word: Shield 3/3, Soul Warding at 36 (4 seconds shorter cooldown, 15% cheaper), Penance at 38 and Renewed Hope from 39."},{t="p",s="level",x="40–60 · Aegis and Power Infusion"},{t="p",x="Renewed Hope reaches 5/5 at 44, Divine Aegis 3/3 by 46 turns critical heals into shields, and Power Infusion at 48 gives a target 20% more spell damage and healing for 15 seconds. Holy Specialization 5/5 by 53 adds 5% Holy critical chance, Divine Fury 5/5 by 58 shortens Smite, Holy Fire, Heal and Greater Heal by 0.5 seconds, and Inner Focus completes the build at 60."},{t="anchor",id="talents"},{t="kicker",x=S[393]},{t="h2",x=S[519]},{t="p",x=S[60]},{t="widget",w="talents"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[421]},{t="widget",w="ranks"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[375]},{t="p",x=S[144]},{t="widget",w="order"},{t="p",s="notice",x="A group alternative: take Silent Resolve instead of Twilight Focus when you heal dungeons and pull threat. You can also respec at 35 to take Penance earlier, keeping Spirit Tap for mana. Divine Aegis shields absorb 15% of a non-periodic critical heal (capped by your level) for 12 seconds; Renewed Hope adds 10% critical chance on targets with Weakened Soul and shortens it by 5 seconds, so you can shield them again sooner."},{t="anchor",id="stats"},{t="kicker",x=S[482]},{t="h2",x=S[405]},{t="p",x="Discipline wants healing power first, then mana stats. Critical strike matters more here than for Holy because it triggers Divine Aegis and benefits from Renewed Hope."},{t="h3",x=S[538]},{t="stat",i=1,b=S[578],x=S[579]},{t="stat",i=2,b="Intellect",x=S[565]},{t="stat",i=3,b="Spirit",x=S[459]},{t="stat",i=4,b="Stamina",x=""},{t="stat",i=5,b=S[498],x=S[613]},{t="p",s="small",x="Wands with spell damage, Intellect and Spirit are good leveling picks."},{t="h3",x="At level 60"},{t="stat",i=1,b=S[498],x=""},{t="stat",i=2,b="Mana per 5",x=""},{t="stat",i=3,b="Spirit",x=""},{t="stat",i=4,b="Intellect",x=""},{t="stat",i=5,b=S[523],x=""},{t="p",s="small",x="Some estimates put Intellect second. Aim for a lot of all three of healing power, Intellect and Spirit, then refine by fight length."},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[75]},{t="anchor",id="combat"},{t="kicker",x=S[406]},{t="h2",x=S[432]},{t="p",x="Treat this as a priority list, not a fixed loop. Leave out what you have not learned yet: Holy Fire at 20, Penance at 38 and Power Infusion at 48 in this order."},{t="h4",x=S[466]},{t="p",x="Keep Power Word: Fortitude and Inner Fire up. Inner Fire has 20 charges, and each melee or ranged hit you take removes one; recast it when they run out. Shield yourself or the tank before the pull."},{t="h4",x="Solo damage"},{t="p",x="Holy Fire on the furthest or priority target, Smite as it approaches, Penance on the target with your Holy Fire, then Mind Blast and Shadow Word: Pain. Finish with your wand to save mana. Power in Light needs your Holy Fire or Shadow Word: Pain on the target."},{t="h4",x="Shield and Penance in groups"},{t="p",x="Shield whoever is about to take damage. Penance’s first heal is instant, so it is your fast response. Heals on a shielded target (Weakened Soul) crit more often through Renewed Hope, and critical heals leave Divine Aegis shields."},{t="h4",x="Heal, Renew and Flash Heal"},{t="p",x="Heal for steady damage, Renew for chip damage or while you move, Flash Heal only in emergencies because it costs much more mana. Prayer of Healing is for a party that is badly hurt."},{t="h4",x=S[580]},{t="p",x="Dispel Magic and Cure Disease (Abolish Disease from 32) only when the effect is worth the mana. Fade drops your threat when you pull enemies off the tank."},{t="h4",x="Cooldowns"},{t="p",x="Inner Focus makes the next spell free with 25% more critical chance; use it on an expensive heal. Power Infusion gives a caster or yourself 20% more damage and healing for 15 seconds."},{t="abil",names={S[581],"Penance","Smite","Holy Fire","Heal","Flash Heal","Renew",S[537],"Inner Focus"}},{t="h3",x=S[467]},{t="p",x="Priority for Discipline: healing power, mana per 5 seconds, Intellect, Spirit, then critical strike. Critical strike matters more here than for Holy because it triggers Divine Aegis and benefits from Renewed Hope."},{t="p",x="A strong wand is your main damage source until the mid-30s: Novice’s Practice Wand (1), Lesser Magic Wand (5) and Greater Magic Wand (13) from Enchanting, then Gravestone Scepter from Blackfathom Deeps. Priests start with one-handed maces and wands; learn Staves at a weapon master."},{t="h3",x=S[422]},{t="p",x="Mana is your limit. Carry water, use Spirit Tap and Meditation between pulls, and take it slow with a new group. When unsure, wand instead of casting damage spells so you never run out of mana for healing."},{t="p",x="Every Priest learns Fear Ward and Devouring Plague at 20 in Forever, and Divine Spirit at 30. Each race also has two Priest-only racial spells, such as Desperate Prayer and Chastise for Dwarves or Contingency Plan for Gnomes."},{t="anchor",id="macros"},{t="kicker",x=S[483]},{t="h2",x=S[340]},{t="p",x=S[52]},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[53]},{t="macro",n=S[389],x=S[86],code=S[146]},{t="macro",n=S[524],x=S[105],code=S[196]},{t="macro",n=S[460],x=S[117],code=S[171]},{t="macro",n=S[356],x=S[97],code=S[136]},{t="macro",n=S[433],x=S[113],code=S[162]},{t="macro",n=S[468],x=S[161],code=S[175]},{t="macro",n=S[348],x=S[152],code=S[390]},{t="macro",n=S[434],x=S[184],code=S[195]},{t="macro",n=S[461],x=S[192],code=S[289]},{t="macro",n="Penance heal, Shift for damage",x="Heals the ally under your pointer, your friendly target or yourself; hold Shift to hit your enemy target instead. A second press while it channels does not restart it.",code="#showtooltip Penance\n/stopmacro [channeling:Penance]\n/cast [mod:shift,harm,nodead][@mouseover,help,nodead][help,nodead][@player] Penance"},{t="macro",n="Mouseover Power Infusion",x="Gives the ally under your pointer, your friendly target or yourself 20% more spell damage and healing for 15 seconds.",code="#showtooltip Power Infusion\n/cast [@mouseover,help,nodead][help,nodead][@player] Power Infusion"},{t="macro",n="Mouseover Heal",x="Your steady, efficient heal from 16. Use a lower rank when the full rank would overheal.",code="#showtooltip Heal\n/cast [@mouseover,help,nodead][help,nodead][@player] Heal"},{t="macro",n="Mouseover Shadow Word: Pain",x="Applies Shadow Word: Pain to the enemy under your pointer or your target. Power in Light counts it as well as Holy Fire for bonus Smite and Penance damage.",code="#showtooltip Shadow Word: Pain\n/cast [@mouseover,harm,nodead][harm,nodead] Shadow Word: Pain"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[226]},{t="anchor",id="dungeons"},{t="kicker",x=S[525]},{t="h2",x=S[376]},{t="p",x=S[55]},{t="widget",w="rarity"},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[56]},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[29]},{t="widget",w="loot"},{t="anchor",id="professions"},{t="kicker",x=S[407]},{t="h2",x=S[373]},{t="p",x=S[66]},{t="widget",w="prof"},{t="anchor",id="crafting"},{t="kicker",x=S[423]},{t="h2",x=S[357]},{t="p",x=S[25]},{t="widget",w="craft"},{t="anchor",id="questgear"},{t="kicker",x=S[408]},{t="h2",x=S[332]},{t="p",x=S[28]},{t="widget",w="quest"},{t="anchor",id=S[388]},{t="kicker",x=S[526]},{t="h2",x="Your notes"},{t="widget",w="notes"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[87]}}},{id="holy",name="Holy",token="HOLY",gearBrackets={{b="Quest rewards",no="Quest rewards that fit this spec's stat priority, sorted by quest level. The tooltip names the quest, its level, the quest giver and the faction. Quest level is not the minimum pickup level.",keys={"st-priest-3","st-priest-1","priest-g102","priest-g99","priest-g130","priest-g162","priest-g31","priest-g190","priest-g137","priest-g36","priest-g71","priest-g98","priest-g151","priest-g156","priest-g78","priest-g111","priest-g68","priest-g105","priest-g157","priest-g27","priest-g76","priest-g145","priest-g159","priest-g163","priest-g164","priest-g19","priest-g74","priest-g9