-g109","priest-g655"}}},title="Holy | WoW Forever Priest Field Guide",nav={{id="overview",x=S[552]},{id="journey",x=S[446]},{id="talents",x=S[392]},{id="stats",x=S[477]},{id="combat",x=S[478]},{id="macros",x=S[479]},{id="dungeons",x=S[420]},{id="professions",x=S[447]},{id="crafting",x=S[431]},{id="questgear",x=S[412]},{id=S[388],x=S[522]}},asideNote=S[72],talentString="02300500103000000033205101032021531005",ranks={{tree="Discipline",name=S[402],r=2,max=2},{tree="Discipline",name=S[442],r=3,max=5},{tree="Discipline",name=S[339],r=5,max=5},{tree="Discipline",name="Inner Focus",r=1,max=1},{tree="Discipline",name="Meditation",r=3,max=3},{tree="Holy",name=S[471],r=3,max=3},{tree="Holy",name=S[602],r=3,max=3},{tree="Holy",name=S[403],r=2,max=5},{tree="Holy",name="Divine Fury",r=5,max=5},{tree="Holy",name="Holy Nova",r=1,max=1},{tree="Holy",name="Inspiration",r=1,max=3},{tree="Holy",name=S[591],r=3,max=3},{tree="Holy",name=S[609],r=2,max=2},{tree="Holy",name=S[598],r=2,max=2},{tree="Holy",name=S[548],r=1,max=1},{tree="Holy",name=S[414],r=5,max=5},{tree="Holy",name=S[588],r=3,max=3},{tree="Holy",name=S[505],r=1,max=1},{tree="Shadow",name="Spirit Tap",r=5,max=5}},order={{l1=10,l2=11,tree="Discipline",name=S[402],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=12,l2=16,tree="Shadow",name="Spirit Tap",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=17,l2=19,tree="Holy",name=S[471],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=20,l2=22,tree="Holy",name=S[602],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=23,l2=25,tree="Discipline",name=S[442],r1=1,r2=3,max=5},{l1=26,l2=30,tree="Discipline",name=S[339],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=31,l2=33,tree="Discipline",name="Meditation",r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=34,l2=37,tree="Holy",name="Divine Fury",r1=1,r2=4,max=5},{l1=38,l2=38,tree="Holy",name="Holy Nova",r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=39,l2=39,tree="Holy",name="Inspiration",r1=1,r2=1,max=3},{l1=40,l2=40,tree="Holy",name="Divine Fury",r1=5,r2=5,max=5},{l1=41,l2=42,tree="Holy",name=S[403],r1=1,r2=2,max=5},{l1=43,l2=44,tree="Holy",name=S[609],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=45,l2=47,tree="Holy",name=S[591],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=48,l2=48,tree="Holy",name=S[548],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=49,l2=50,tree="Holy",name=S[598],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=51,l2=52,tree="Holy",name=S[414],r1=1,r2=2,max=5},{l1=53,l2=55,tree="Holy",name=S[588],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=56,l2=57,tree="Holy",name=S[414],r1=3,r2=4,max=5},{l1=58,l2=58,tree="Holy",name=S[505],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=59,l2=59,tree="Holy",name=S[414],r1=5,r2=5,max=5},{l1=60,l2=60,tree="Discipline",name="Inner Focus",r1=1,r2=1,max=1}},blocks={{t="anchor",id="overview"},{t="p",s="eyebrow",x=S[413]},{t="h1",x="Holy",sub=S[481]},{t="p",s="lede",x="Reactive group healing: Renew, Heal and Flash Heal for the tank, Prayer of Mending bouncing through the party, Litany of Light refunding mana, and Holy Nova when Searing Light makes it free."},{t="pills",list={S[520],"Dungeon and group healing",S[448]}},{t="anchor",id="journey"},{t="kicker",x=S[553]},{t="h2",x=S[355]},{t="p",x="These stages follow the talent order below. Holy is the easier healing tree to pick up; it levels best in groups, and Holy Nova gives it the only area damage a Priest has."},{t="p",s="level",x=S[547]},{t="p",x="Shoot with a wand between spells; Power Word: Shield arrives at 6 and Renew at 8. Wand Specialization 2/2 at 11, Spirit Tap 5/5 by 16 and Twilight Focus 3/3 by 19 make solo questing smoother and protect your casts from pushback."},{t="p",s="level",x="20–39 · Renew and efficiency"},{t="p",x="Improved Renew 3/3 by 22 adds 15% to Renew, Twin Disciplines 3/5 by 25 adds 3% to instant spells, Mental Strength 5/5 by 30 adds 10% Intellect, and Meditation 3/3 by 33 lets half of your mana regeneration continue while casting. Divine Fury follows, with Holy Nova at 38 and Inspiration at 39."},{t="p",s="level",x="40–60 · Spirit and Mending"},{t="p",x="Divine Fury reaches 5/5 at 40 (with Greater Heal), then Holy Specialization, Searing Light (free Holy Nova procs from Holy Fire), Improved Healing (15% cheaper heals), Spirit of Redemption at 48 and Litany of Light 2/2 by 50. Spiritual Guidance and Spiritual Healing fill 51–59, Prayer of Mending arrives at 58 and Inner Focus completes the build at 60."},{t="anchor",id="talents"},{t="kicker",x=S[393]},{t="h2",x=S[520]},{t="p",x=S[60]},{t="widget",w="talents"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[421]},{t="widget",w="ranks"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[375]},{t="p",x=S[144]},{t="widget",w="order"},{t="p",s="notice",x="Holy Binding (Flash Heal heals you for 50% as much) is an option if you take damage while healing; this build does not take it. Litany of Light refunds 10% of a heal’s base mana cost when your previous heal was a different spell, and Spiritual Guidance turns 25% of your Spirit into healing power."},{t="anchor",id="stats"},{t="kicker",x=S[482]},{t="h2",x=S[405]},{t="p",x="Holy wants healing power first, then the mana stats that keep you casting. Spiritual Guidance turns Spirit into extra healing."},{t="h3",x=S[538]},{t="stat",i=1,b=S[578],x=S[579]},{t="stat",i=2,b="Intellect",x=S[565]},{t="stat",i=3,b="Spirit",x="also adds healing with Spiritual Guidance"},{t="stat",i=4,b="Stamina",x=""},{t="stat",i=5,b=S[498],x=S[613]},{t="p",s="small",x="Holy levels best in groups; keep a healing set for dungeons."},{t="h3",x="At level 60"},{t="stat",i=1,b=S[498],x=""},{t="stat",i=2,b="Mana per 5",x=""},{t="stat",i=3,b="Spirit",x=""},{t="stat",i=4,b="Intellect",x=""},{t="stat",i=5,b=S[523],x=""},{t="p",s="small",x="Critical strike is last because a crit often overheals. Some estimates put Intellect second."},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[75]},{t="anchor",id="combat"},{t="kicker",x=S[406]},{t="h2",x=S[432]},{t="p",x="Treat this as a priority list, not a fixed loop. Heal arrives at 16, Flash Heal at 20, Holy Nova at 38, Greater Heal at 40 and Prayer of Mending at 58 in this order."},{t="h4",x=S[466]},{t="p",x="Keep Power Word: Fortitude and Inner Fire up, and Divine Spirit from 30. Shield yourself or the tank before the pull."},{t="h4",x="Solo damage"},{t="p",x="Holy Fire on the furthest or priority target, Smite as it approaches, then Mind Blast and Shadow Word: Pain, and finish with your wand. Against several enemies, use Holy Nova when Searing Light makes it free."},{t="h4",x="Renew and Prayer of Mending"},{t="p",x="Keep Renew on the tank while they take steady damage; several Priests’ Renews can share a target in Forever. Place Prayer of Mending on whoever is about to take damage so it heals and jumps through the group."},{t="h4",x="Heal and Greater Heal"},{t="p",x="Heal (Greater Heal from 40) for moderate healing after a few seconds. Use lower ranks so you do not overheal; alternating different heals triggers Litany of Light refunds."},{t="h4",x="Emergencies"},{t="p",x="Power Word: Shield buys time, Flash Heal is the fast but expensive answer, and Prayer of Healing heals the whole party when everyone is hurt. Inner Focus makes one big heal free."},{t="h4",x=S[580]},{t="p",x="Dispel Magic and Cure Disease (Abolish Disease from 32) when the effect is worth removing. Fade if enemies turn to you."},{t="abil",names={"Renew","Heal","Greater Heal","Flash Heal",S[505],"Prayer of Healing","Holy Nova",S[581],"Inner Focus"}},{t="h3",x=S[467]},{t="p",x="Priority for Holy: healing power, mana per 5 seconds, Spirit (Spiritual Guidance turns it into healing), Intellect, and critical strike last, since a crit often just overheals."},{t="p",x="A strong wand is your main damage source until the mid-30s: Novice’s Practice Wand (1), Lesser Magic Wand (5) and Greater Magic Wand (13) from Enchanting, then Gravestone Scepter from Blackfathom Deeps. Learn Staves at a weapon master before your first staff."},{t="h3",x=S[422]},{t="p",x="Heal with lower ranks to avoid overhealing, alternate different heals for Litany of Light, and let Renew finish before refreshing it. Keep enough mana for an emergency Flash Heal."},{t="p",x="Spirit of Redemption keeps you healing for 15 seconds after death. Every Priest learns Fear Ward and Devouring Plague at 20 and Divine Spirit at 30 in Forever."},{t="anchor",id="macros"},{t="kicker",x=S[483]},{t="h2",x=S[340]},{t="p",x=S[52]},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[53]},{t="macro",n=S[389],x=S[86],code=S[146]},{t="macro",n=S[524],x=S[105],code=S[196]},{t="macro",n=S[460],x=S[117],code=S[171]},{t="macro",n=S[356],x=S[97],code=S[136]},{t="macro",n=S[433],x=S[113],code=S[162]},{t="macro",n=S[468],x=S[161],code=S[175]},{t="macro",n=S[348],x=S[152],code=S[390]},{t="macro",n=S[434],x=S[184],code=S[195]},{t="macro",n=S[461],x=S[192],code=S[289]},{t="macro",n="Mouseover Prayer of Mending",x="Places Prayer of Mending on the ally under your pointer, your friendly target or yourself. Put it on someone about to take damage.",code="#showtooltip Prayer of Mending\n/cast [@mouseover,help,nodead][help,nodead][@player] Prayer of Mending"},{t="macro",n="Greater Heal, Shift for Rank 1",x="Normal press casts your highest Greater Heal; Shift casts Rank 1 for a smaller, cheaper heal. Learned at 40.",code="#showtooltip Greater Heal\n/cast [mod:shift,@mouseover,help,nodead][mod:shift,help,nodead][mod:shift,@player] Greater Heal(Rank 1); [@mouseover,help,nodead][help,nodead][@player] Greater Heal"},{t="macro",n="Inner Focus and Greater Heal",x="Makes the next Greater Heal free with 25% more critical chance, on the ally under your pointer, your friendly target or yourself.",code="#showtooltip Inner Focus\n/cast Inner Focus\n/cast [@mouseover,help,nodead][help,nodead][@player] Greater Heal"},{t="macro",n="Holy Nova",x="Damages enemies and heals party members within 10 yards. Best when Searing Light makes it free.",code="#showtooltip Holy Nova\n/cast Holy Nova"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[226]},{t="anchor",id="dungeons"},{t="kicker",x=S[525]},{t="h2",x=S[376]},{t="p",x=S[55]},{t="widget",w="rarity"},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[56]},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[29]},{t="widget",w="loot"},{t="anchor",id="professions"},{t="kicker",x=S[407]},{t="h2",x=S[373]},{t="p",x=S[66]},{t="widget",w="prof"},{t="anchor",id="crafting"},{t="kicker",x=S[423]},{t="h2",x=S[357]},{t="p",x=S[25]},{t="widget",w="craft"},{t="anchor",id="